{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T18:54:42.057Z","entries":{"docs-7.25\u0000## lcd **Conditions:** !smips **Syscap:** lcd **Type:** Settings Directory":"## lcd \n**Conditions:** !smips\n**Syscap:** lcd\n**Type:** 设置目录","docs-7.25\u0000## lcd/take-screenshot **Conditions:** !smips **Syscap:** lcd **Type:** Command":"## lcd/take-screenshot \n**Conditions:** !smips\n**Syscap:** lcd\n**Type:** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## log **Type:** Directory":"## log \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## mpls/forwarding-table **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## mpls/forwarding-table \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** Directory","docs-7.25\u0000## mpls/interface **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## mpls/interface \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** Directory","docs-7.25\u0000## mpls/ldp **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## mpls/ldp \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## mpls/ldp/accept-filter **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## mpls/ldp/accept-filter \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## mpls/ldp/advertise-filter **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## mpls/ldp/advertise-filter \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## mpls/ldp/interface **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## mpls/ldp/interface \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** Directory","docs-7.25\u0000## mpls/ldp/local-mapping **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## mpls/ldp/local-mapping \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## mpls/ldp/neighbor **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## mpls/ldp/neighbor \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** Directory","docs-7.25\u0000## mpls/ldp/remote-mapping **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## mpls/ldp/remote-mapping \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## mpls/mangle **Type:** Directory":"## mpls/mangle\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## mpls/mangle/reset-counters **Type:** Command":"## mpls/mangle/reset-counters \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## mpls/mangle/reset-counters-all **Type:** Command":"## mpls/mangle/reset-counters-all \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000List of discovered and statically configured LDP neighbors.":"已发现和静态配置的 LDP 邻居列表。","docs-7.25\u0000List of label bindings that should be accepted from LDP neighbors.":"应从 LDP 邻居接受的标签绑定列表。","docs-7.25\u0000Log entries the router keeps in memory: the default `memory` buffer, the buffers of other memory actions and the newest entries of disk actions. `/log/print` lists the entries of every buffer; `where buffer=<action name>` limits the output to one of them, `follow` keeps printing new entries, `follow-only` prints only new ones, `with-extra-info` appends the extra fields, and `file=<name>` saves the output to `<name>.txt`. The `/log/info`, `/log/warning`, `/log/error` and `/log/debug` commands add a message with the topics `script` and the level, the same as `:log` in a script. Which messages are kept is set by the rules in [`/system/logging`](LINK). See [Log](LINK).":"路由器保存在内存中的日志条目：默认 `memory` 缓冲区、其他 memory action 的缓冲区以及 disk action 的最新条目。`/log/print` 列出每个缓冲区的条目；`where buffer=<action name>` 将输出限制为其中一个缓冲区，`follow` 持续打印新条目，`follow-only` 仅打印新条目，`with-extra-info` 追加额外字段，`file=<name>` 将输出保存到 `<name>.txt`。`/log/info`、`/log/warning`、`/log/error` 和 `/log/debug` 命令会添加一条主题为 `script`、级别与命令对应的消息，与脚本中的 `:log` 相同。保留哪些消息由 [`/system/logging`](/docs/7.25/cli-reference/system/logging) 中的规则设置。请参阅 [Log](/docs/7.25/diagnostics-monitoring-and-troubleshooting/log)。","docs-7.25\u0000The Sub-menu shows label bindings for routes received from other routers. Static mapping can be configured if there is no intention to use LDP dynamically. This table is used to build the Forwarding Table":"该子菜单显示从其他路由器接收的路由的标签绑定。如果不打算动态使用 LDP，可以配置静态映射。该表用于构建 Forwarding Table。","docs-7.25\u0000This sub-menu shows labels bound to the routes locally in the router. In this menu, static mappings can also be configured if there is no intention to use LDP dynamically.":"此子菜单显示路由器中本地绑定到路由的标签。如果不打算动态使用 LDP，也可以在此菜单中配置静态映射。"}}
